â€‹â€‹â€‹â€‹â€‹â€‹â€‹Achievement: In Ghana, Liberia, Burkina Faso, and Cote d&#39;Ivoire the assessment of data quality assessment framework was developed and applied. A calendar of dissemination of the main statistical products is developed and adopted as well. In Sierra Leone, Togo, and Cabo Verde the assessment is under preparation.

