Achievement:&nbsp; The&nbsp;manuals on re procssing and adjustment methodologies to produce and manage all core economic and social statistics on track for all project participating countries.&nbsp; The target will be expected to be achieved before the project closing date.&nbsp;

Explanation:&nbsp;Regional platform built or updated that enables data access, archiving and dissemination.

&nbsp;

Achievement: At the ECOWAS level regional platforms exist and is being updated to enable data access, archiving, and dissemination.

Explanation:&nbsp;The concepts and standards are the one adopted with ECOWAS (NSNA 2008, harmonized methodology for the CPI, harmonized methodology for enterprises surveys) and FAO (AGRI surveys).

&nbsp;

Achievement: All the seven project participating countries are using the concepts and standards adopted by&nbsp;ECOWAS (NSNA 2008, harmonized methodology for the CPI, harmonized methodology for enterprises surveys) and FAO (AGRI surveys).
